### Which Segment Is Most Affected?

**By volume shock: Private resale.** Q1 2026 private transactions fell -39.7% qoq. Sub-sales hit their lowest since Q2 2020 — the SSD did exactly what it was designed to do.

**By price index: HDB, not private.** This is the data surprise. Private prices actually *rose* +0.9% qoq (OCR led at +2.2%). HDB RPI fell -0.1% qoq — the **first quarterly decline since 2019** — and dropped a further -0.6% mom in April. The LTV cut is now biting, amplified by 13,480 MOP units hitting the market in 2026 (up 93% yoy).

**By structural disruption: EC.** The May 8 overhaul kills the "EC carry trade" investment logic entirely. EC as a wealth vehicle is dead for new sites.

