### 90-Day Post-Measure Data Points

- Private rental fell -1.2% qoq (no buyer-pause → rent spike; record completions absorbed displacement)
- Developers held price — no cuts, just managed launch cadence
- Rivelle Tampines (pre-overhaul EC): 92.5% cleared at launch; Coastal Cabana: 66% day 1 — buyers rushed last "old rules" EC window
- April 2026: Tengah (863 units, 99% cleared) + Vela Bay (515 units, 72% day 1) prove latent demand is intact when product/price is right

