### Contrarian Plays

1. **OCR private resale** — lower psf than new launches in same sub-markets; SSD freeze created motivated sellers; entry window before buyer pool expands
2. **HDB mature estate resale** — "first decline in 7 years" is creating artificial hesitation; premium transactions ($1M+) still at record volumes (412 in Q1); genuine reprieve for HDB upgrader clients priced out in 2024-25
3. **CCR is a 12-24 month watch** — not a Q3 2026 play; needs ABSD relaxation or foreign capital acceleration

**Avoid:** New EC under post-8 May rules for any investor-oriented client. The exit mechanics are gone.

